a lot of shame.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.160
She's battling with Hope's
visions of the school.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:12.120
Viv is the
classical people pleaser,

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.960
but she knows internally
that this is morally wrong.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.640
She has a new boyfriend,
Eugene.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.280
She sexted him
for the first time.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.600
Yeah, I'm sorry.

