00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.000
Viv deserves…
Viv deserves Eugene."

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.760
Viv and Eugene.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:46.960
I was so happy.
I was like: "Yes, Viv!"

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.480
