portraying that with Kedar?

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.160
I think we have
such a great chemistry.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.600
We really bounce off
each other's vibes.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.320
I think Jackson and Viv,

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.600
